    <string name="settings_about_title">Game da</string>
    <string name="settings_about_p1">Wannan manhaja aiki ne na gaskiya da aka yi ne kawai domin Allah, kyauta ga kowane musulmi namiji da mace, ina neman lada a gare ni, ga iyayena, ga iyalina, da ga dukan musulmi.</string>
    <string name="settings_about_p2">An bunkasa ta kuma an gina ta da soyayya da himma domin ta yi hidima ga Littafin Allah. Wannan aikin yana da tushen buɗe gaba ɗaya, kuma kowane mai haɓakawa ko mai sha’awa na iya nazarin sa, gyara shi, sake amfani da shi, da raba shi domin haɓaka manhajoji da ke yi wa Musulunci da musulmi hidima. Wanda ya nuna wa wasu hanya zuwa alheri yana samun lada kamar wanda ya aikata alherin.</string>
    <string name="settings_about_p3">Muna roƙon ku ku yi mana addu’a a lokacin da ba mu tare da ku ba.</string>
    <string name="settings_about_open_source_title">Aiki mai buɗaɗɗen tushe</string>
    <string name="settings_about_open_source_text">Wannan aiki ne mai buɗaɗɗen tushe kuma yana buɗe ga kowa don amfana da shi, haɓaka shi, da ba da gudummawa a ciki domin hidimar Littafin Allah, ina neman lada daga Allah.</string>
